- ACTION: 8 typed strategy actions (global_exploration, local_exploitation, uncertainty_sampling, error_guided_sampling, boundary_sampling, surrogate_acquisition, retrain_surrogate, stop). Actions generate x via the backend; the policy never picks x. src/opt_agent/actions/models.py.
